  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe newly added Quick Menu VRChat+ Tab for the most part just links you to the Main Menu. However, double clicking on it does not directly bring you to the Main Menu VRChat+ Tab.\n\nThis is inconsistent with other Tab buttons in the Quick Menu.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nDouble clicking on the VRChat+ Quick Menu Tab should open the Main Menu VRChat+ Tab.\n\nWith this change the tooltip would also need to be updated, it could e.g. be changed to: `Access VRChat+. Double click to view in Main Menu.`\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:",
